# Only what the images need: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md, LICENSE and footfall/ for
# the footfall image, tests/ for its test stage, and the browser image's gate and Chromium
# policy.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!footfall/
!tests/
!images/browsers/gate.js
!images/browsers/chromium-policy.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
